      },
      "description": "Vol'jin is dead, but his spirit is not where it should be. From the war that crowns a new queen of Zandalar to the realm of the dead and back to the Echo Isles, the Darkspear follow their Shadow Hunter one last time.\n\nLegacy content: Chromie Time off.",
