      },
      "description": "Quel'Thalas calls for help, and the forest trolls of Zul'Aman answer as more than old enemies of the elves. The Amani become a people again, and an older curse waits beneath their land.\n\nThe current expansion, Midnight: no Chromie Time.",
      "chapters": [
